<title>UK: Royal &amp; Sun buys back 3.5 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Royal &amp; Sun buys back 3.5 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers Cazenove &amp; Co and ABN AMRO Hoare Govett on Thursday said they had bought 3.5 million shares in Royal &amp; Sun Alliance Insurance Group Plc on behalf of the company.</p>
<p>The brokers confirmed earlier market reports they had bought the shares at 465 pence a share.</p>
<p>Royal &amp;Sun last week said it would repurchase up to five percent of its shares after it posted its results.</p>
<p>More than 15 million shares were bought back at 479p on May 20.</p>
<p>Royal &amp; Sun shares closed down seven pence at 463-1/2.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
</text>
